# Dev-only build flags. The committed local-stack defaults live in
# `.env.development` (tracked, applied ONLY by the debug build type;
# defaultConfig stays release-safe). `.env.local` is your gitignored
# per-machine override, overlaid on top at Gradle-configure time
# (decisions §136). See the .env.development header + README "Quick start".
.env.local
